        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bright and Spacious Dual-Aspect Two-Bedroom First-Floor Apartment on Castle Avenue\r\n\r\nSituated in a mature and sought-after development on Castle Avenue, this bright and spacious dual-aspect first-floor apartment offers well-proportioned accommodation in a convenient and highly regarded location. The property has been newly redecorated throughout.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with a useful storage cupboard, leading to a generously proportioned living room with a dining area. The separate kitchen is fully fitted and features high-gloss units.\r\n\r\nA second hallway, with an airing cupboard, provides access to two spacious double bedrooms, both with ample built-in storage, and a newly fitted luxury bathroom. The property benefits from gas-fired central heating and parking for one car.\r\n\r\nCastle Avenue is a prestigious address within easy walking distance of Clontarf Road and the picturesque Dublin Bay. The area offers excellent public transport connections to Dublin City Centre, together with a wide range of local shops, cafés, restaurants and other amenities nearby.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nEmail Enquiries Only\r\nPlease email your enquiry with full details to arrange a viewing. Due to the volume of enquiries, we may not be able to respond to everyone."
